					description:
						"Defines the default rounding mode specification of new decimal fields (NUMERIC OR BIGNUMERIC) in the table. During table creation or update, if a decimal field is added to this table without an explicit rounding mode specified, then the field inherits the table default rounding mode. Changing this field doesn't affect existing fields. Values: `ROUND_HALF_AWAY_FROM_ZERO` - ROUND_HALF_AWAY_FROM_ZERO rounds half values away from zero when applying precision and scale upon writing of NUMERIC and BIGNUMERIC values. For Scale: 0 1.1, 1.2, 1.3, 1.4 => 1 1.5, 1.6, 1.7, 1.8, 1.9 => 2; `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` - ROUND_HALF_EVEN rounds half values to the nearest even value when applying precision and scale upon writing of NUMERIC and BIGNUMERIC values. For Scale: 0 1.1, 1.2, 1.3, 1.4 => 1 1.5 => 2 1.6, 1.7, 1.8, 1.9 => 2 2.5 => 2.",
