		description: 'Lists all jobs that you started in the specified project, newest first.',
		context:
			"---\nname: listJobs\ndescription: Lists all jobs that you started in the specified project, newest first.\n---\n\nReturns one page of jobs created in the project within the last six months, sorted by creation time descending. Only your own jobs are listed unless `allUsers` is `true` (requires the Owner role on the project).\n\nFilter by state with `stateFilter` (`done`, `pending`, `running`; several values allowed), by creation time window with `minCreationTime` / `maxCreationTime` (milliseconds since the Unix epoch), or by `parentJobId` to list the child jobs of a script. `projection` `full` includes the job configuration; `minimal` omits it.\n\nPaging: `maxResults` sizes the page; pass the previous response's `nextPageToken` as `pageToken`. Use the getJob endpoint to fetch a single job with full statistics.\n\nReference: [jobs.list](https://cloud.google.com/bigquery/docs/reference/rest/v2/jobs/list).\n",
